# Deployment answers and secrets — the token PIN and the database password live here.
# ⚠️ NOT A CONVENIENCE: the build stage does `COPY . .`, so anything not excluded lands in
# that layer and in the exported buildx cache, even though the runtime image copies only
# named artifacts out of it. A secret in a cached layer is a secret published to everything
# that can read the cache.
deploy/.env
**/.env
